"maydonlar hamda uchta bosqich qo'shiladi: :guilabel:`New`, :guilabel:`In "
"Progress` va :guilabel:`Done`. :guilabel:`Pipeline status bar` "
"va :guilabel:`Kanban State` maydoni :ref:`Forma ko'rinishi <studio/views/"
"general/form>`ga qo'shiladi. :guilabel:`Color` maydoni :ref:`Ro'yxat "
"ko'rinishi <studio/views/multiple-records/list>`ga qo'shiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/models_modules_apps.rst:105
