msgstr ""
"faqat Studio yordamida qilingan moslashtirishlarni eksport qilish uchun "
"belgilash kataklarini belgilanmagan holda qoldiring."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/models_modules_apps.rst:273
msgid ""
"tick :guilabel:`Include Data` to include data from the selected models in "
