#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Text`: Eight fonts are available: Lato, Roboto, Open Sans, "
"Montserrat, Oswald, Raleway, Tajawal (which supports Arabic and Latin "
"scripts), and Fira Mono. Go to the `Google Fonts website <https://"
"fonts.google.com/>`_ to preview them."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Text`: Sakkizta shrift mavjud: Lato, Roboto, Open Sans, "
"Montserrat, Oswald, Raleway, Tajawal (arab va lotin yozuvlarini qo'llab-"
"quvvatlaydi) va Fira Mono. Ularni oldindan ko'rish uchun `Google Fonts veb-"
"saytiga <https://fonts.google.com/>`_ o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company logo`: Click the :guilabel:`Edit` button to upload or "
"change the logo. This adds the logo to the company’s record on the *Company* "
"model, which you can access by going to :menuselection:`Settings` and then "
"clicking :guilabel:`Update Info` in the :guilabel:`Companies` section."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Company logo`: Logotipni yuklash yoki o'zgartirish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Edit` tugmasini bosing. Bu logotipni *Company* modelidagi "
"kompaniya yozuviga qo'shadi; unga :menuselection:`Settings` yo'lidan o'tib, "
"so'ngra :guilabel:`Companies` bo'limida :guilabel:`Update Info` tugmasini "
"bosib kirishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:96
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Colors`: Change the primary and secondary colors used to "
"structure reports. The default colors are automatically generated based on "
"the colors of the logo."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Colors`: Hisobotlarni tuzishda ishlatiladigan asosiy va "
"ikkilamchi ranglarni o'zgartiring. Standart ranglar logotip ranglari asosida "
"avtomatik ravishda yaratiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:101
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Address`: The company name and address are displayed in the "
"header of :ref:`external reports <studio/pdf-reports/header-footer>`. You "
"can add multiple lines of text."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Address`: Kompaniya nomi va manzili :ref:`tashqi hisobotlarning "
"<studio/pdf-reports/header-footer>` yuqori qismida (header) ko'rsatiladi. "
"Bir nechta matn qatorlarini qo'shishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:106
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tagline`: This is displayed in the header of :ref:`external "
"reports <studio/pdf-reports/header-footer>` using the Light, Striped, "
"Bubble, Wave and Folder layouts and in the footer of external reports using "
"the Boxed and Bold layouts. You can add multiple lines of text."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tagline`: Bu Light, Striped, Bubble, Wave va Folder maketlaridan "
"foydalanadigan :ref:`tashqi hisobotlarning <studio/pdf-reports/header-"
"footer>` yuqori qismida (header) hamda Boxed va Bold maketlaridan "
"foydalanadigan tashqi hisobotlarning pastki qismida (footer) ko'rsatiladi. "
"Bir nechta matn qatorlarini qo'shishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:113
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Footer`: This text is used in the footer of :ref:`external "
"reports <studio/pdf-reports/header-footer>`. You can add multiple lines of "
"text. You can also edit the footer using the :ref:`report editor <studio/pdf-"
"reports/edit>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Footer`: Bu matn :ref:`tashqi hisobotlarning <studio/pdf-reports/"
"header-footer>` pastki qismida (footer) ishlatiladi. Bir nechta matn "
"qatorlarini qo'shishingiz mumkin. Pastki qismni (footer) :ref:`hisobot "
"muharriri <studio/pdf-reports/edit>` yordamida ham tahrirlashingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Paper format`: This defines the default paper size of reports. "
"You can select :guilabel:`A4` (21 cm x 29.7 cm) and :guilabel:`US Letter` "
"(21.59 cm x 27.54 cm). This can also be defined for individual reports in "
"the :guilabel:`Paper format` field in :ref:`Studio <studio/pdf-reports/edit-"
"options>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Paper format`: Bu hisobotlarning standart qog'oz o'lchamini "
"belgilaydi. :guilabel:`A4` (21 sm x 29.7 sm) va :guilabel:`US Letter` (21.59 "
"sm x 27.54 sm) formatlarini tanlashingiz mumkin. Buni :ref:`Studio <studio/"
"pdf-reports/edit-options>` da :guilabel:`Paper format` maydonida alohida "
"hisobotlar uchun ham belgilash mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:125
msgid ""
"Other paper formats may be available depending on which apps or modules you "
"have installed, for example, label sheets for the Inventory app or event "
"badges for the Events app."
msgstr ""
"O'rnatilgan ilovalar yoki modullarga qarab boshqa qog'oz formatlari ham "
"mavjud bo'lishi mumkin, masalan, Inventory ilovasi uchun yorliq varaqlari "
"yoki Events ilovasi uchun tadbir beydjlari."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:131
msgid "Creating new PDF reports"
msgstr "Yangi PDF hisobotlar yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:133
msgid ""
"To create a new report for a :doc:`model </applications/studio/"
"models_modules_apps>`, (e.g., sales orders) access the model, click "
"the :icon:`oi-studio` (:guilabel:`Toggle Studio`) button, then "
"click :guilabel:`Reports`. Click :guilabel:`New` and, in the popup window "
"that opens, select the type of report. This is solely used to determine what "
"is displayed in the header and footer:"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Model </applications/studio/models_modules_apps>` uchun (masalan, "
"sotuv buyurtmalari) yangi hisobot yaratish uchun modelga kiring, :icon:`oi-"
"studio` (:guilabel:`Toggle Studio`) tugmasini bosing, "
"so'ngra :guilabel:`Reports` tugmasini bosing. :guilabel:`New` tugmasini "
"bosing va ochilgan qalqib chiquvchi oynada hisobot turini tanlang. Bu faqat "
"yuqori qismda (header) va pastki qismda (footer) nima ko'rsatilishini "
"aniqlash uchun ishlatiladi:"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:141
msgid ":guilabel:`External`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`External`:"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:143
msgid ""
"The header displays the company's :ref:`logo <studio/pdf-reports/default-"
"layout-logo>` and its :ref:`name and address <studio/pdf-reports/default-"
"layout-address>`. For reports using the Light, Striped, Bubble, Wave and "
"Folder layouts, the :ref:`tagline <studio/pdf-reports/default-layout-"
"tagline>` also appears in the header."
msgstr ""
"Yuqori qismda (header) kompaniyaning :ref:`logotipi <studio/pdf-reports/"
"default-layout-logo>` hamda uning :ref:`nomi va manzili <studio/pdf-reports/"
"default-layout-address>` ko'rsatiladi. Light, Striped, Bubble, Wave va "
"Folder maketlaridan foydalanadigan hisobotlarda :ref:`shior <studio/pdf-"
"reports/default-layout-tagline>` ham yuqori qismda (header) paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:148
msgid ""
"The footer displays the values set in the :ref:`Footer <studio/pdf-reports/"
"default-layout-footer>` field and the page number. For reports using the "
"Boxed and Bold layouts, the :ref:`tagline <studio/pdf-reports/default-layout-"
"tagline>` also appears in the footer."
msgstr ""
"Pastki qismda (footer) :ref:`Footer <studio/pdf-reports/default-layout-"
"footer>` maydonida belgilangan qiymatlar va sahifa raqami ko'rsatiladi. "
"Boxed va Bold maketlaridan foydalanadigan hisobotlarda :ref:`shior <studio/"
"pdf-reports/default-layout-tagline>` ham pastki qismda (footer) paydo "
"bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:153
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Internal`: The header displays the user's current date and time, "
"the company's :ref:`name and address <studio/pdf-reports/default-layout-"
"address>` and the page number. There is no footer."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Internal`: Yuqori qismda (header) foydalanuvchining joriy sanasi "
"va vaqti, kompaniyaning :ref:`nomi va manzili <studio/pdf-reports/default-"
"layout-address>` hamda sahifa raqami ko'rsatiladi. Pastki qism (footer) "
"mavjud emas."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:157
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Blank`: There is neither a header nor a footer. Click in the "
"upper left corner of the page to edit the report."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Blank`: Na yuqori qism (header), na pastki qism (footer) mavjud. "
"Hisobotni tahrirlash uchun sahifaning yuqori chap burchagini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:160
msgid ""
"Once you have created the report, you can start :ref:`editing it <studio/pdf-"
"reports/edit>`."
msgstr ""
"Hisobotni yaratganingizdan so'ng, uni :ref:`tahrirlashni <studio/pdf-reports/"
"edit>` boshlashingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:165
msgid "Editing PDF reports"
msgstr "PDF hisobotlarni tahrirlash"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:167
msgid ""
"To access the reports available for a model, access the model, click "
"the :icon:`oi-studio` (:guilabel:`Toggle Studio`) button, then "
"click :guilabel:`Reports`. Select an existing report to open it."
msgstr ""
"Model uchun mavjud hisobotlarga kirish uchun modelga o'ting, :icon:`oi-"
"studio` (:guilabel:`Toggle Studio`) tugmasini bosing, "
"so'ngra :guilabel:`Reports` tugmasini bosing. Ochish uchun mavjud hisobotni "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:171
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can also open Studio, click :guilabel:`Reports`, and "
"search for a specific report or model."
msgstr ""
"Shuningdek, Studio'ni ochib, :guilabel:`Reports` tugmasini bosishingiz va "
"muayyan hisobot yoki modelni qidirishingiz ham mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:175
msgid ""
"It is strongly recommended to **duplicate** the standard report and make "
"changes in the duplicated version. To duplicate a report, hover the mouse "
"pointer on the top right corner of the report, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"vertical` (:guilabel:`vertical ellipsis`) icon, and then "
"select :guilabel:`Duplicate`."
msgstr ""
"Standart hisobotni **nusxalash** va o'zgarishlarni nusxalangan versiyada "
"kiritish qat'iy tavsiya etiladi. Hisobotni nusxalash uchun sichqoncha "
"kursorini hisobotning yuqori o'ng burchagiga olib boring, :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"vertical` (:guilabel:`vertical ellipsis`) belgisini bosing, "
"so'ngra :guilabel:`Duplicate` bandini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:0
msgid "Duplicating a PDF report"
msgstr "PDF hisobotni nusxalash"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:186
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Parametrlar"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:188
msgid ""
"Once you have selected or created a report, you can use the options in the "
"left part of the screen to:"
msgstr ""
"Hisobotni tanlaganingizdan yoki yaratganingizdan so'ng, ekranning chap "
"qismidagi parametrlardan quyidagilar uchun foydalanishingiz mumkin:"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:191
msgid ""
"Change the :guilabel:`Report name`: The new name is applied everywhere (in "
"Studio, in the :guilabel:`Print` menu under the :icon:`fa-cog` "
"(:guilabel:`gear`) icon in the form view, and in the PDF file name)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Report name` maydonini o'zgartirish: Yangi nom hamma joyda "
"qo'llaniladi (Studio'da, forma ko'rinishidagi :icon:`fa-cog` "
"(:guilabel:`gear`) belgisi ostidagi :guilabel:`Print` menyusida va PDF fayl "
"nomida)."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:194
msgid ""
"Modify the :guilabel:`Paper format`: If no value is selected, the format "
"defined in the :ref:`default layout <studio/pdf-reports/default-layout-"
"paper>` is used."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Paper format` maydonini o'zgartirish: Agar hech qanday qiymat "
"tanlanmagan bo'lsa, :ref:`standart maketda <studio/pdf-reports/default-"
"layout-paper>` belgilangan format ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:196
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Show in print menu`: to add the report to the :guilabel:`Print` "
"menu in the form view."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Show in print menu`: hisobotni forma "
"ko'rinishidagi :guilabel:`Print` menyusiga qo'shish uchun."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:197
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reload from attachment`: to save the report as an attachment on "
"the record the first time it is generated and reload the original version of "
"the report any subsequent time. This is legally required for invoices and is "
"mainly used in this case."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Reload from attachment`: hisobot birinchi marta yaratilganda uni "
"yozuvga biriktirma sifatida saqlash va keyingi har safar hisobotning asl "
"versiyasini qayta yuklash uchun. Bu hisob-fakturalar uchun qonunan talab "
"qilinadi va asosan shu holatda ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:200
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Limit visibility to groups`: to limit the availability of the PDF "
"report to specific :doc:`user groups <../general/users/access_rights>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Limit visibility to groups`: PDF hisobotning mavjudligini "
"muayyan :doc:`foydalanuvchi guruhlari <../general/users/access_rights>` "
"bilan cheklash uchun."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:202
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Edit sources`: to modify the report directly in the :ref:`XML "
"file <studio/pdf-reports/XML-editing>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Edit sources`: hisobotni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri :ref:`XML faylida "
"<studio/pdf-reports/XML-editing>` o'zgartirish uchun."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:204
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reset report`: to discard all changes made to the report and "
"reset it to its standard version."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Reset report`: hisobotga kiritilgan barcha o'zgarishlarni bekor "
"qilish va uni standart versiyasiga qaytarish uchun."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:206
msgid ":guilabel:`Print preview`: to generate and download a report preview."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Print preview`: hisobotning oldindan ko'rinishini yaratish va "
"yuklab olish uchun."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:211
msgid "Report editor"
msgstr "Hisobot muharriri"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:213
msgid ""
"The report editor allows you to modify the content and formatting of the "
"report."
msgstr ""
"Hisobot muharriri hisobotning mazmuni va formatlanishini o'zgartirish "
"imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:216
msgid ""
"You can :guilabel:`Undo` or :guilabel:`Redo` changes using the related "
"buttons or the shortcuts `CTRL` + `Z` and `CTRL` + `Y`."
msgstr ""
"O'zgarishlarni tegishli tugmalar yoki `CTRL` + `Z` va `CTRL` + `Y` tezkor "
"tugmalari yordamida :guilabel:`Undo` (bekor qilish) yoki :guilabel:`Redo` "
"(qaytarish) qilishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:219
msgid ""
"Changes are saved automatically when you leave the report or manually using "
"the :guilabel:`Save` button."
msgstr ""
"O'zgarishlar hisobotdan chiqqaningizda avtomatik ravishda "
"yoki :guilabel:`Save` tugmasi yordamida qo'lda saqlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:222
msgid ""
"You can reset the report to its standard version by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Reset report` button in the left part of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Ekranning chap qismidagi :guilabel:`Reset report` tugmasini bosish orqali "
"hisobotni standart versiyasiga qaytarishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:226
msgid ""
"Editing the header and footer of a report impacts all standard and custom "
"reports."
msgstr ""
"Hisobotning yuqori qismi (header) va pastki qismini (footer) tahrirlash "
"barcha standart va maxsus hisobotlarga ta'sir qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:229
msgid "Conditional blocks"
msgstr "Shartli bloklar"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:231
msgid ""
"The dashed rectangles represent **conditional blocks** (*if/else* "
"statements). These are used to show/hide content based on specific "
"conditions. Click on the block to view the conditions."
msgstr ""
"Shtrixli to'rtburchaklar **shartli bloklarni** (*if/else* iboralari) "
"ifodalaydi. Ular muayyan shartlar asosida mazmunni ko'rsatish/yashirish "
"uchun ishlatiladi. Shartlarni ko'rish uchun blokni bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:None
msgid "View conditions applied to a block."
msgstr "Blokka qo'llanilgan shartlarni ko'rish."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:237
msgid ""
"Select a value to preview its corresponding output and edit it if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Unga mos natijani oldindan ko'rish uchun qiymatni tanlang va kerak bo'lsa "
"uni tahrirlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:None
msgid "Preview the output of another condition."
msgstr "Boshqa shart natijasini oldindan ko'rish."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:243
msgid ""
"Conditions can only be edited in the :ref:`XML <studio/pdf-reports/XML-"
"editing>`."
msgstr ""
"Shartlarni faqat :ref:`XML <studio/pdf-reports/XML-editing>` orqali "
"tahrirlash mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:246
msgid "Other content"
msgstr "Boshqa mazmun"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:248
msgid "There are two types of text content in reports:"
msgstr "Hisobotlarda ikki turdagi matn mazmuni mavjud:"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:250
msgid ""
"Static text, i.e., the text that is not highlighted in blue, which can be "
"modified directly in the editor."
msgstr ""
"Statik matn, ya'ni ko'k rangda ajratilmagan matn bo'lib, uni to'g'ridan-"
"to'g'ri muharrirda o'zgartirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:252
msgid ""
"Dynamic text, i.e., the text that is highlighted in blue, which is replaced "
"by :doc:`field </applications/studio/fields>` values when the report is "
"generated, e.g., the sales order number or the quotation date."
msgstr ""
"Dinamik matn, ya'ni ko'k rangda ajratilgan matn bo'lib, hisobot "
"yaratilganda :doc:`maydon </applications/studio/fields>` qiymatlari bilan "
"almashtiriladi, masalan, sotuv buyurtmasi raqami yoki taklifnoma sanasi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:256
msgid ""
"You can add content (e.g., fields, lists, tables, images, banners, etc.) to "
"the report using commands. Type `/` to open the :ref:`powerbox <essentials/"
"html_editor/commands>`, then type the command's name or select it from the "
"list."
msgstr ""
"Hisobotga buyruqlar yordamida mazmun (masalan, maydonlar, ro'yxatlar, "
"jadvallar, rasmlar, bannerlar va h.k.) qo'shishingiz mumkin. :ref:`powerbox "
"<essentials/html_editor/commands>` oynasini ochish uchun `/` belgisini "
"kiriting, so'ngra buyruq nomini yozing yoki uni ro'yxatdan tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:260
msgid "To add static text to the report, type the text where you want it."
msgstr "Hisobotga statik matn qo'shish uchun matnni kerakli joyga kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:262
msgid ""
"For more advanced changes, you can :ref:`edit the report in the XML directly "
"<studio/pdf-reports/XML-editing>`."
msgstr ""
"Yanada murakkab o'zgarishlar uchun :ref:`hisobotni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri XML "
"orqali tahrirlashingiz <studio/pdf-reports/XML-editing>` mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:268
msgid "Add a field"
msgstr "Maydon qo'shish"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:270
msgid ""
"To add a field, type `/` and select the :guilabel:`Field` command. In the "
"list that opens, select or search for the field; click the right arrow next "
"to the field name to access the list of related fields if needed. Then, "
"specify the default value that will be shown if the field is not completed "
"in the record and press `Enter`."
msgstr ""
"Maydon qo'shish uchun `/` belgisini kiriting va :guilabel:`Field` buyrug'ini "
"tanlang. Ochilgan ro'yxatdan maydonni tanlang yoki qidiring; kerak bo'lsa, "
"bog'liq maydonlar ro'yxatiga kirish uchun maydon nomi yonidagi o'ng "
"strelkani bosing. So'ngra, yozuvda maydon to'ldirilmagan bo'lsa "
"ko'rsatiladigan standart qiymatni belgilang va `Enter` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:None
msgid "Select a related field."
msgstr "Bog'liq maydonni tanlash."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:281
msgid "Add or edit a table"
msgstr "Jadval qo'shish yoki tahrirlash"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:283
msgid "There are two types of tables in reports:"
msgstr "Hisobotlarda ikki turdagi jadvallar mavjud:"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:285
msgid ""
":ref:`Static tables <studio/pdf-reports/static-table>`, which are used to "
"display static text or fields. For this type of table, you define the number "
"of columns and rows when adding the table."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Statik jadvallar <studio/pdf-reports/static-table>` statik matn yoki "
"maydonlarni ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladi. Bu turdagi jadval uchun jadvalni "
"qo'shishda ustunlar va qatorlar sonini belgilaysiz."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:287
msgid ""
":ref:`Dynamic tables <studio/pdf-reports/dynamic-table>`, which are used to "
"display data from :ref:`relational fields <studio/fields/relational-"
"fields>`. For this type of table, you only define the number of columns when "
"adding the table. The number of rows in the generated report will be "
"determined by the number of records in the related model that are linked "
"with the current model."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Dinamik jadvallar <studio/pdf-reports/dynamic-table>` :ref:`aloqador "
"maydonlardagi <studio/fields/relational-fields>` ma'lumotlarni ko'rsatish "
"uchun ishlatiladi. Bu turdagi jadval uchun jadvalni qo'shishda faqat "
"ustunlar sonini belgilaysiz. Yaratilgan hisobotdagi qatorlar soni joriy "
"model bilan bog'langan tegishli modeldagi yozuvlar soni bilan aniqlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:294
msgid ""
"In a sales order report, a dynamic table is used to show the order lines "
"related to the sales order. If the sales order contains 10 order lines, the "
"table in the generated report has 10 rows; if it contains two order lines, "
"the table has two rows."
msgstr ""
"Sotuv buyurtmasi hisobotida dinamik jadval sotuv buyurtmasiga tegishli "
"buyurtma qatorlarini ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladi. Agar sotuv buyurtmasida "
"10 ta buyurtma qatori bo'lsa, yaratilgan hisobotdagi jadvalda 10 ta qator "
"bo'ladi; agar ikkita buyurtma qatori bo'lsa, jadvalda ikkita qator bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:301
msgid "Add or edit a static table"
msgstr "Statik jadval qo'shish yoki tahrirlash"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:303
msgid ""
"To add a static table, type `/` and select the :guilabel:`Table` command. "
"Determine the number of columns and rows for the table. Once the table has "
"been added, you can start editing it."
msgstr ""
"Statik jadval qo'shish uchun `/` belgisini kiriting va :guilabel:`Table` "
"buyrug'ini tanlang. Jadval uchun ustunlar va qatorlar sonini aniqlang. "
"Jadval qo'shilgandan so'ng, uni tahrirlashni boshlashingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:306
msgid ""
"You can insert, move and delete columns and rows using the table tools. "
"Position the cursor on top of the column or to the left of the row then "
"click the purple rectangle and select an option."
msgstr ""
"Jadval vositalari yordamida ustunlar va qatorlarni kiritish, ko'chirish va "
"o'chirishingiz mumkin. Kursorni ustunning yuqorisiga yoki qatorning chap "
"tomoniga joylashtiring, so'ngra binafsha to'rtburchakni bosing va variantni "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:None
msgid "List of available options for editing table structure."
msgstr "Jadval tuzilmasini tahrirlash uchun mavjud variantlar ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:312
msgid ""
"To resize a column, drag the column border to the desired position; reset "
"all columns to their standard size by selecting :guilabel:`Reset Size` from "
"the table tools."
msgstr ""
"Ustun o'lchamini o'zgartirish uchun ustun chegarasini kerakli joyga sudrab "
"olib boring; jadval vositalaridan :guilabel:`Reset Size` bandini tanlash "
"orqali barcha ustunlarni standart o'lchamiga qaytaring."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:315
msgid ""
"Add the :ref:`field of your choice <studio/pdf-reports/add-field>` in a cell "
"or add static text by typing."
msgstr ""
"Katakka :ref:`o'zingiz tanlagan maydonni <studio/pdf-reports/add-field>` "
"qo'shing yoki matn kiritish orqali statik matn qo'shing."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:319
msgid ""
"To add text in a structured way without using a table, you can use columns. "
"Add columns by typing `/` and selecting the appropriate "
"command: :guilabel:`2 columns`, :guilabel:`3 columns` or :guilabel:`4 "
"columns`."
msgstr ""
"Jadvaldan foydalanmasdan matnni tuzilgan tarzda qo'shish uchun ustunlardan "
"foydalanishingiz mumkin. `/` belgisini kiritib, tegishli buyruqni tanlash "
"orqali ustunlar qo'shing: :guilabel:`2 columns`, :guilabel:`3 columns` "
"yoki :guilabel:`4 columns`."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:326
msgid "Add or edit a dynamic table"
msgstr "Dinamik jadval qo'shish yoki tahrirlash"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:329
msgid ""
"Only relations of type `one2many` or `many2many` can be displayed as dynamic "
"tables."
msgstr ""
"Faqat `one2many` yoki `many2many` turidagi aloqalarni dinamik jadval "
"sifatida ko'rsatish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:330
msgid ""
"An existing dynamic table in a standard report has a more complex structure "
"than a dynamic table you add yourself. For such tables, it is possible to "
"insert or delete columns; it is not possible to move columns or to insert, "
"move or delete rows."
msgstr ""
"Standart hisobotdagi mavjud dinamik jadval siz o'zingiz qo'shgan dinamik "
"jadvalga qaraganda murakkabroq tuzilishga ega. Bunday jadvallar uchun "
"ustunlarni kiritish yoki o'chirish mumkin; ustunlarni ko'chirish yoki "
"qatorlarni kiritish, ko'chirish yoki o'chirish mumkin emas."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:334
msgid ""
"To add a dynamic table, type `/` and select the :guilabel:`Dynamic Table` "
"command. In the list that opens, select or search for the relation the table "
"will be based on and press `Enter`. Once the table has been added, you can "
"start editing it."
msgstr ""
"Dinamik jadval qo'shish uchun `/` belgisini kiriting va :guilabel:`Dynamic "
"Table` buyrug'ini tanlang. Ochilgan ro'yxatdan jadval asoslanadigan aloqani "
"tanlang yoki qidiring va `Enter` tugmasini bosing. Jadval qo'shilgandan "
"so'ng, uni tahrirlashni boshlashingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:338
msgid ""
"You can insert, move and delete columns using the table tools, as for "
"a :ref:`static table <studio/pdf-reports/static-table>`. It is also possible "
"to insert static rows that will appear above or below the generated rows."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Statik jadvaldagi <studio/pdf-reports/static-table>` kabi, jadval "
"vositalari yordamida ustunlarni kiritish, ko'chirish va o'chirishingiz "
"mumkin. Shuningdek, yaratilgan qatorlarning yuqorisida yoki pastida paydo "
"bo'ladigan statik qatorlarni kiritish ham mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:342
msgid ""
"To add a field to a cell, delete any placeholder text then add "
"the :ref:`field of your choice <studio/pdf-reports/add-field>`. The dialog "
"box that opens shows the source object for the field (e.g., the *Order "
"Lines* model) and the list of available fields."
msgstr ""
"Katakka maydon qo'shish uchun har qanday to'ldiruvchi matnni o'chiring, "
"so'ngra :ref:`o'zingiz tanlagan maydonni <studio/pdf-reports/add-field>` "
"qo'shing. Ochilgan muloqot oynasi maydon uchun manba obyektini (masalan, "
"*Order Lines* modeli) va mavjud maydonlar ro'yxatini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:None
msgid "List of available fields for the sale order lines model."
msgstr "Sotuv buyurtmasi qatorlari modeli uchun mavjud maydonlar ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:349
msgid "Replace the :guilabel:`Column name` label by the label of your choice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Column name` yorlig'ini o'zingiz tanlagan yorliq bilan "
"almashtiring."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:352
msgid ""
"The default row automatically iterates over the field's content, generating "
"a row on the report for each field value (e.g., one row per order line)."
msgstr ""
"Standart qator maydon mazmuni bo'ylab avtomatik ravishda takrorlanib, har "
"bir maydon qiymati uchun hisobotda qator yaratadi (masalan, har bir buyurtma "
"qatori uchun bitta qator)."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:356
msgid "Formatting"
msgstr "Formatlash"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:358
msgid ""
"To format text in the report, select it, then format it using the options in "
"the :doc:`text editor </applications/essentials/html_editor>`."
msgstr ""
"Hisobotdagi matnni formatlash uchun uni tanlang, so'ngra :doc:`matn "
"muharriri </applications/essentials/html_editor>` parametrlaridan foydalanib "
"formatlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:0
msgid "Format text using the text editor."
msgstr "Matnni matn muharriri yordamida formatlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:367
msgid "Editing the report's XML"
msgstr "Hisobotning XML kodini tahrirlash"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:370
msgid ""
"Modifying the XML directly may result in report issues during :doc:`upgrades "
"<../../../administration/upgrade>`. If this happens, simply copy your "
"changes from the old database into your upgraded database."
msgstr ""
"XML kodini to'g'ridan-to'g'ri o'zgartirish :doc:`yangilashlar <../../../"
"administration/upgrade>` vaqtida hisobot muammolariga olib kelishi mumkin. "
"Agar bu sodir bo'lsa, shunchaki o'zgarishlaringizni eski ma'lumotlar "
"bazasidan yangilangan ma'lumotlar bazasiga nusxalang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:374
msgid ""
"To edit the report's XML, click :guilabel:`Edit sources` in the left pane."
msgstr ""
"Hisobotning XML kodini tahrirlash uchun chap panelda :guilabel:`Edit "
"sources` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:377
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Misollar"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:381
msgid ""
"To change how data is presented in your report, you can modify a field's "
"default :doc:`widget </applications/studio/fields>` manually. In the example "
"below, the order date shows the date and time by default, while the unit "
"price defaults to a precision of two decimal places."
msgstr ""
"Hisobotingizda ma'lumotlar qanday taqdim etilishini o'zgartirish uchun "
"maydonning standart :doc:`vidjetini </applications/studio/fields>` qo'lda "
"o'zgartirishingiz mumkin. Quyidagi misolda buyurtma sanasi standart holatda "
"sana va vaqtni ko'rsatadi, birlik narxi esa standart holatda ikki o'nlik "
"xona aniqligida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:394
msgid ""
"By using `t-options`, in this case the `widget` option, these fields can be "
"modified to show only the date and a precision of four decimal places, "
"respectively:"
msgstr ""
"`t-options`, bu holatda `widget` opsiyasidan foydalanib, bu maydonlarni mos "
"ravishda faqat sanani va to'rt o'nlik xona aniqligini ko'rsatadigan qilib "
"o'zgartirish mumkin:"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:407
msgid ""
"If you want to show/hide content based on specific conditions, you can "
"manually add `if/else` control statements in the report XML."
msgstr ""
"Agar kontentni muayyan shartlarga qarab ko'rsatish/yashirishni istasangiz, "
"hisobot XML kodiga qo'lda `if/else` boshqaruv operatorlarini qo'shishingiz "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:410
msgid ""
"For example, if you want to hide a custom data table if there are no tags, "
"you can use the `t-if` attribute to define the condition, which is then "
"evaluated as `True` or `False`. The table will not be displayed if there are "
"no tags in the quotation."
msgstr ""
"Masalan, teglar bo'lmaganda maxsus ma'lumotlar jadvalini yashirishni "
"istasangiz, shartni belgilash uchun `t-if` atributidan foydalanishingiz "
"mumkin, bu shart keyin `True` yoki `False` sifatida baholanadi. Agar "
"taklifnomada teglar bo'lmasa, jadval ko'rsatilmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:439
msgid ""
"If you want to display another block in case the `t-if` statement is "
"evaluated as `False`, you can specify it using the `t-else` statement. The "
"`t-else` block must directly follow the `t-if` block in the document "
"structure. There is no need to specify any condition in the `t-else` "
"attribute. As an example, let's show a quick message explaining that there "
"are no tags on the quotation:"
msgstr ""
"Agar `t-if` operatori `False` deb baholangan holatda boshqa blokni "
"ko'rsatishni istasangiz, uni `t-else` operatori yordamida belgilashingiz "
"mumkin. `t-else` bloki hujjat tuzilmasida `t-if` blokidan bevosita keyin "
"kelishi kerak. `t-else` atributida hech qanday shart belgilash shart emas. "
"Misol sifatida, taklifnomada teglar yo'qligini tushuntiruvchi qisqa xabarni "
"ko'rsatamiz:"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:471
msgid ""
"By using the `t-if/t-else` notation, the report editor recognizes that these "
"sections are mutually exclusive and should be displayed as conditional "
"blocks:"
msgstr ""
"`t-if/t-else` yozuvidan foydalanilganda, hisobot muharriri bu bo'limlar bir-"
"birini istisno qilishini va shartli bloklar sifatida ko'rsatilishi "
"kerakligini aniqlaydi:"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:0
msgid "Output preview if there are tags."
msgstr "Teglar mavjud bo'lgan holatda natijaning oldindan ko'rinishi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:477
msgid "You can switch conditions using the editor to preview their output:"
msgstr ""
"Natijalarini oldindan ko'rish uchun muharrir yordamida shartlarni "
"almashtirishingiz mumkin:"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:0
msgid "Output preview if there are no tags."
msgstr "Teglar mavjud bo'lmagan holatda natijaning oldindan ko'rinishi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:482
msgid ""
"If you wish to have multiple options, you can also use `t-elif` directives "
"to add intermediary conditions. For example, this is how the title of sales "
"order reports changes based on the condition of the underlying document."
msgstr ""
"Agar bir nechta variantga ega bo'lishni istasangiz, oraliq shartlarni "
"qo'shish uchun `t-elif` direktivalaridan ham foydalanishingiz mumkin. "
"Masalan, sotuv buyurtmasi hisobotlarining sarlavhasi asosiy hujjatning "
"holatiga qarab shunday o'zgaradi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:495
msgid ""
"The title *Pro-Forma Invoice* is used depending on some contextual "
"conditions. If these conditions are not met and the state of the document is "
"either `draft` or `sent`, then *Quotation* is used. If none of those "
"conditions are met, the report's title is *Order*."
msgstr ""
"*Pro-Forma Invoice* sarlavhasi ayrim kontekstual shartlarga qarab "
"ishlatiladi. Agar bu shartlar bajarilmasa va hujjatning holati `draft` yoki "
"`sent` bo'lsa, *Quotation* ishlatiladi. Agar bu shartlarning hech biri "
"bajarilmasa, hisobot sarlavhasi *Order* bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:501
msgid ""
"Working with images in a report can be challenging, as precise control over "
"image size and behavior is not always obvious. You can insert image fields "
"using the report editor (by using the :ref:`Field command <studio/pdf-"
"reports/add-field>`), but inserting them in XML using the `t-field` "
"directive and accompanying `t-options` attributes provides better sizing and "
"positioning control."
msgstr ""
"Hisobotda tasvirlar bilan ishlash qiyin bo'lishi mumkin, chunki tasvir "
"o'lchami va xatti-harakati ustidan aniq nazorat har doim ham ravshan emas. "
"Tasvir maydonlarini hisobot muharriri yordamida (:ref:`Field buyrug'i "
"<studio/pdf-reports/add-field>` orqali) kiritishingiz mumkin, ammo ularni "
"XML kodiga `t-field` direktivasi va unga hamroh `t-options` atributlari "
"yordamida kiritish o'lcham va joylashuvni yaxshiroq boshqarish imkonini "
"beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:507
msgid ""
"For example, the following code outputs the field `image_128` of the line's "
"product as a 64px-wide image (with an automatic height based on the image's "
"aspect ratio)."
msgstr ""
"Masalan, quyidagi kod qator mahsulotining `image_128` maydonini kengligi "
"64px bo'lgan tasvir sifatida chiqaradi (balandligi tasvirning tomonlar "
"nisbatiga asoslanib avtomatik belgilanadi)."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:514
msgid "The following options are available for image widgets:"
msgstr "Tasvir vidjetlari uchun quyidagi opsiyalar mavjud:"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:516
msgid ""
"`width`: width of the image, usually in pixels or CSS length units (e.g., "
"`rem`) (leave empty for auto-width)."
msgstr ""
"`width`: tasvirning kengligi, odatda piksellarda yoki CSS uzunlik "
"birliklarida (masalan, `rem`) (avtomatik kenglik uchun bo'sh qoldiring)."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:518
msgid ""
"`height`: height of the image, usually in pixels or CSS length units (e.g., "
"`rem`) (leave empty for auto-height)."
msgstr ""
"`height`: tasvirning balandligi, odatda piksellarda yoki CSS uzunlik "
"birliklarida (masalan, `rem`) (avtomatik balandlik uchun bo'sh qoldiring)."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:520
msgid ""
"`class`: CSS classes applied on the `img` tag; `Bootstrap classes <https://"
"getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/content/tables>`_ are available."
msgstr ""
"`class`: `img` tegiga qo'llaniladigan CSS klasslari; `Bootstrap klasslari "
"<https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/content/tables>`_ mavjud."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:522
msgid "`alt`: alternative text of the image"
msgstr "`alt`: tasvirning muqobil matni"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:523
msgid ""
"`style`: style attribute; it allows you to override styles more freely than "
"with `Bootstrap classes <https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/content/tables>`_."
msgstr ""
"`style`: stil atributi; u `Bootstrap klasslari <https://getbootstrap.com/"
"docs/5.1/content/tables>`_ ga qaraganda stillarni erkinroq qayta belgilash "
"imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:526
msgid ""
"These attributes must contain strings, i.e., text enclosed within quotes "
"within quotes, e.g., `t-options-width=\"'64px'\"` (or, alternatively, a "
"valid Python expression)."
msgstr ""
"Bu atributlar satrlardan iborat bo'lishi kerak, ya'ni qo'shtirnoq ichidagi "
"qo'shtirnoqqa olingan matn, masalan, `t-options-width=\"'64px'\"` (yoki "
"muqobil ravishda, yaroqli Python ifodasi)."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:530
msgid ""
"The image widget cannot be used on an `img` tag. Instead, set the `t-field` "
"directive on a `span` (for inline content) or `div` (for block content) node."
msgstr ""
"Tasvir vidjetini `img` tegida ishlatib bo'lmaydi. Buning o'rniga `t-field` "
"direktivasini `span` (ichki qatorli kontent uchun) yoki `div` (blokli "
"kontent uchun) tuguniga o'rnating."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:533
msgid ""
"For example, let's add a column with the product image in the quotation "
"table:"
msgstr "Masalan, taklifnoma jadvaliga mahsulot tasviri bilan ustun qo'shamiz:"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:561
msgid ""
"The `t-options-width` attribute restricts the image width to 64 pixels, and "
"the Bootstrap classes used in `t-options-class` create a thumbnail-like "
"border with rounded corners and a shadow."
msgstr ""
"`t-options-width` atributi tasvir kengligini 64 piksel bilan cheklaydi, `t-"
"options-class` da ishlatilgan Bootstrap klasslari esa yumaloq burchaklar va "
"soyaga ega eskiz ko'rinishidagi hoshiyani yaratadi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:0
msgid "Add a column with the product image in the quotation table."
msgstr "Taklifnoma jadvaliga mahsulot tasviri bilan ustun qo'shish."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:3
msgid "Views"
msgstr "Ko'rinishlar"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:5
msgid ""
"Views are the interface that allows displaying the data contained in "
"a :doc:`model <models_modules_apps>`. One model can have several views, "
"which are simply different ways to show the same data. In Studio, views are "
"organized into four categories: :ref:`general <studio/views/"
"general>`, :ref:`multiple records <studio/views/multiple-"
"records>`, :ref:`timeline <studio/views/timeline>`, and :ref:`reporting "
"<studio/views/reporting>`."
msgstr ""
"Ko'rinishlar — bu :doc:`model <models_modules_apps>` ichidagi ma'lumotlarni "
"ko'rsatish imkonini beruvchi interfeys. Bitta model bir nechta ko'rinishga "
"ega bo'lishi mumkin, ular shunchaki bir xil ma'lumotlarni ko'rsatishning "
"turli usullaridir. Studio'da ko'rinishlar to'rt toifaga "
"bo'linadi: :ref:`umumiy <studio/views/general>`, :ref:`bir nechta yozuvlar "
"<studio/views/multiple-records>`, :ref:`vaqt chizig'i <studio/views/"
"timeline>` va :ref:`hisobot <studio/views/reporting>`."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:12
msgid ""
"To change the default view of a model, :ref:`access Studio <studio/access>`, "
"go to :guilabel:`Views`, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
"(:guilabel:`ellipsis`) icon next to the desired view, and "
"click :guilabel:`Set as Default`."
msgstr ""
"Modelning standart ko'rinishini o'zgartirish uchun :ref:`Studio'ga kiring "
"<studio/access>`, :guilabel:`Views` bo'limiga o'ting, kerakli ko'rinish "
"yonidagi :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`ellipsis`) belgisini bosing "
"va :guilabel:`Set as Default` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:15
msgid ""
"You can modify views using the built-in XML editor: Activate "
"the :ref:`Developer mode <developer-mode>`, go to the view you want to edit, "
"select the :guilabel:`View` tab, and click :guilabel:`</> XML`."
msgstr ""
"Ko'rinishlarni o'rnatilgan XML muharriri yordamida o'zgartirishingiz "
"mumkin: :ref:`Dasturchi rejimini <developer-mode>` faollashtiring, "
"tahrirlamoqchi bo'lgan ko'rinishga o'ting, :guilabel:`View` varag'ini "
"tanlang va :guilabel:`</> XML` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:20
msgid ""
"If you are editing a view using the XML editor, avoid making changes "
"directly to standard and inherited views, as these would be reset and lost "
"during updates or module upgrades. Always make sure you select the right "
"Studio inherited views: When you modify a view in Studio by dragging and "
"dropping a new field, for example, a specific Studio inherited view and its "
"corresponding XPath, which defines the modified part of the view, are "
"automatically generated."
msgstr ""
"Agar ko'rinishni XML muharriri yordamida tahrirlayotgan bo'lsangiz, standart "
"va meros qilib olingan ko'rinishlarga to'g'ridan-to'g'ri o'zgartirish "
"kiritishdan saqlaning, chunki bu o'zgarishlar yangilanishlar yoki modul "
"yangilashlari vaqtida qayta o'rnatilib, yo'qoladi. Har doim to'g'ri Studio "
"meros ko'rinishlarini tanlaganingizga ishonch hosil qiling: Masalan, "
"Studio'da ko'rinishni yangi maydonni sudrab olib qo'yish orqali "
"o'zgartirganingizda, maxsus Studio meros ko'rinishi va ko'rinishning "
"o'zgartirilgan qismini belgilaydigan unga mos XPath avtomatik ravishda "
"yaratiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:30
msgid "General views"
msgstr "Umumiy ko'rinishlar"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:33
#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:115
#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:223
#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:338
msgid ""
"The settings described below are found under the view's :guilabel:`View` tab "
"unless specified otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Quyida tavsiflangan sozlamalar, agar boshqacha ko'rsatilmagan bo'lsa, "
"ko'rinishning :guilabel:`View` varag'ida joylashgan."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:39
msgid "Form"
msgstr "Forma"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:41
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Form` :icon:`fa-address-card` view is used when creating and "
"editing records, such as contacts, sales orders, products, etc."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Form` :icon:`fa-address-card` ko'rinishi kontaktlar, sotuv "
"buyurtmalari, mahsulotlar kabi yozuvlarni yaratish va tahrirlashda "
"ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:44
msgid ""
"To structure a form, drag and drop the :guilabel:`Tabs and Columns` element "
"found under the :guilabel:`+ Add` tab."
msgstr ""
"Formani tuzilmalash uchun :guilabel:`+ Add` varag'ida "
"joylashgan :guilabel:`Tabs and Columns` elementini sudrab olib qo'ying."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:46
msgid ""
"To prevent users from creating, editing, deleting or duplicating records, "
"untick :guilabel:`Can Create`, :guilabel:`Can Edit`, :guilabel:`Can Delete` "
"or :guilabel:`Can Duplicate`."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchilarning yozuvlarni yaratishi, tahrirlashi, o'chirishi yoki "
"nusxalashining oldini olish uchun :guilabel:`Can Create`, :guilabel:`Can "
"Edit`, :guilabel:`Can Delete` yoki :guilabel:`Can Duplicate` belgilarini "
"olib tashlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:48
msgid ""
"To add a button, click :guilabel:`Add a button` at the top of the form, "
"enter a :guilabel:`Label`, and select the button's action:"
msgstr ""
"Tugma qo'shish uchun forma yuqorisidagi :guilabel:`Add a button` tugmasini "
"bosing, :guilabel:`Label` kiriting va tugmaning amalini tanlang:"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:51
#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:164
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Run a Server Action`: select the :ref:`server action <reference/"
"actions/server>` to be executed from the dropdown list;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Run a Server Action`: ochiluvchi ro'yxatdan bajarilishi kerak "
"bo'lgan :ref:`server amalini <reference/actions/server>` tanlang;"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:53
#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:166
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Call a method`: specify an existing Python method already defined "
"in Odoo."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Call a method`: Odoo'da allaqachon belgilangan mavjud Python "
"metodini ko'rsating."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:55
msgid ""
"To change a button's label or style, click the button and edit "
"its :guilabel:`Label` or :guilabel:`Class` (either `btn-primary` for a "
"*primary* button or `btn-secondary` for a *secondary* button) in "
"the :guilabel:`Properties` tab."
msgstr ""
"Tugmaning yorlig'i yoki stilini o'zgartirish uchun tugmani bosing "
"va :guilabel:`Properties` varag'ida uning :guilabel:`Label` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Class` qiymatini (*asosiy* tugma uchun `btn-primary` yoki "
"*ikkilamchi* tugma uchun `btn-secondary`) tahrirlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:60
msgid ""
"*Primary* buttons represent the main action(s) the user can take in a "
"specific view, e.g., :guilabel:`Send` a request for quotation, and are more "
"visually prominent. *Secondary* buttons offer alternative or less common "
"actions, e.g., :guilabel:`Print` or :guilabel:`Preview` a request for "
"quotation, and are less visually prominent. By default, a new button is "
"styled as a secondary button."
msgstr ""
"*Asosiy* tugmalar foydalanuvchi muayyan ko'rinishda bajarishi mumkin bo'lgan "
"asosiy amal(lar)ni ifodalaydi, masalan, taklifnoma "
"so'rovini :guilabel:`Send` qilish, va vizual jihatdan ko'proq ajralib "
"turadi. *Ikkilamchi* tugmalar muqobil yoki kamroq ishlatiladigan amallarni "
"taklif qiladi, masalan, taklifnoma so'rovini :guilabel:`Print` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Preview` qilish, va vizual jihatdan kamroq ajralib turadi. "
"Standart holatda yangi tugma ikkilamchi tugma sifatida stillashtiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:66
msgid ""
"To add a smart button, click the :icon:`fa-plus-square` (:guilabel:`plus`) "
"icon in the top-right corner of the form. Enter a :guilabel:`Label`, choose "
"an :guilabel:`Icon`, and select a :ref:`related field <studio/fields/"
"relational-fields-related-field>`."
msgstr ""
"Smart tugma qo'shish uchun formaning yuqori o'ng burchagidagi :icon:`fa-plus-"
"square` (:guilabel:`plus`) belgisini bosing. :guilabel:`Label` "
"kiriting, :guilabel:`Icon` tanlang va :ref:`bog'liq maydonni <studio/fields/"
"relational-fields-related-field>` tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:0
msgid "Quotation Template model's Form view"
msgstr "Quotation Template modelining Forma ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:78
msgid "Activity"
msgstr "Faoliyat"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:80
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Activity` :icon:`fa-clock-o` view is used to schedule and "
"have an overview of activities (emails, calls, etc.) linked to records."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Activity` :icon:`fa-clock-o` ko'rinishi yozuvlarga bog'langan "
"faoliyatlarni (elektron pochta xabarlari, qo'ng'iroqlar va h.k.) "
"rejalashtirish va ularning umumiy ko'rinishini olish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:84
msgid "This view can only be modified within Studio by editing the XML code."
msgstr ""
"Bu ko'rinishni Studio ichida faqat XML kodini tahrirlash orqali o'zgartirish "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:0
msgid "Lead/Opportunity model's Activity view"
msgstr "Lead/Opportunity modelining Faoliyat ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:94
msgid "Search"
msgstr "Qidiruv"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:96
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Search` :icon:`oi-search` view is added on top of other views "
"to filter, group, and search records."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Search` :icon:`oi-search` ko'rinishi yozuvlarni filtrlash, "
"guruhlash va qidirish uchun boshqa ko'rinishlar ustiga qo'shiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:99
msgid ""
"To add custom :guilabel:`Filters` and structure them "
"using :guilabel:`Separators`, go to the :guilabel:`+ Add` tab and drag and "
"drop them under :guilabel:`Filters`."
msgstr ""
"Maxsus :guilabel:`Filters` qo'shish va ularni :guilabel:`Separators` "
"yordamida tuzilmalash uchun :guilabel:`+ Add` varag'iga o'ting hamda "
"ularni :guilabel:`Filters` ostiga sudrab olib qo'ying."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:101
msgid ""
"To add an existing field under the search dropdown menu, go to "
"the :guilabel:`+ Add` tab and drag and drop it "
"under :guilabel:`Autocompletion Fields`."
msgstr ""
"Mavjud maydonni qidiruv ochiluvchi menyusi ostiga qo'shish "
"uchun :guilabel:`+ Add` varag'iga o'ting va uni :guilabel:`Autocompletion "
"Fields` ostiga sudrab olib qo'ying."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:0
msgid "Project model's Search view on the Kanban view"
msgstr "Project modelining Kanban ko'rinishidagi Qidiruv ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:112
msgid "Multiple records views"
msgstr "Bir nechta yozuvlar ko'rinishlari"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:121
msgid "Kanban"
msgstr "Kanban"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:123
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Kanban` :icon:`oi-view-kanban` view is often used to support "
"business flows by moving records across stages or as an alternative way to "
"display records inside *cards*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kanban` :icon:`oi-view-kanban` ko'rinishi ko'pincha yozuvlarni "
"bosqichlar bo'ylab ko'chirish orqali biznes jarayonlarini qo'llab-quvvatlash "
"uchun yoki yozuvlarni *kartochkalar* ichida ko'rsatishning muqobil usuli "
"sifatida ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:127
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Kanban` view exists, it is used by default to display data "
"on mobile devices instead of the :ref:`List view <studio/views/multiple-"
"records/list>`."
msgstr ""
"Agar :guilabel:`Kanban` ko'rinishi mavjud bo'lsa, u mobil qurilmalarda "
"ma'lumotlarni ko'rsatish uchun standart holatda :ref:`Ro'yxat ko'rinishi "
"<studio/views/multiple-records/list>` o'rniga ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:130
msgid ""
"To prevent users from creating new records, untick :guilabel:`Can Create`."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchilar yangi yozuvlar yaratishining oldini olish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Can Create` belgisini olib tashlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:131
msgid ""
"To create records directly within the view, in a minimalistic form, "
"enable :guilabel:`Quick Create`."
msgstr ""
"Yozuvlarni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri ko'rinish ichida, minimalistik formada "
"yaratish uchun :guilabel:`Quick Create` opsiyasini yoqing."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:133
#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:160
msgid ""
"To set a default grouping for records, select a field "
"under :guilabel:`Default Group By`."
msgstr ""
"Yozuvlar uchun standart guruhlashni o'rnatish uchun :guilabel:`Default Group "
"By` ostidan maydonni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:0
msgid "Project model's Kanban view"
msgstr "Project modelining kanban ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:143
msgid "List"
msgstr "Ro'yxat"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:145
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`List` :icon:`oi-view-list` view is used to overview many "
"records at once, look for records, and edit simple records."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`List` :icon:`oi-view-list` ko'rinishi bir vaqtning o'zida ko'plab "
"yozuvlarni ko'rib chiqish, yozuvlarni qidirish va oddiy yozuvlarni "
"tahrirlash uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:148
msgid ""
"To prevent users from creating, editing, deleting or duplicating records, "
"untick :guilabel:`Can Create`, :guilabel:`Can Edit`, :guilabel:`Can Delete`, "
"or :guilabel:`Can Duplicate`."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchilar yozuvlarni yaratishi, tahrirlashi, o'chirishi yoki nusxa "
"olishining oldini olish uchun :guilabel:`Can Create`, :guilabel:`Can "
"Edit`, :guilabel:`Can Delete` yoki :guilabel:`Can Duplicate` belgisini olib "
"tashlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:150
msgid ""
"To create and edit records directly within the view, select "
"either :guilabel:`Add record at the bottom`, :guilabel:`Add record on top` "
"or :guilabel:`Open form view` under :guilabel:`When Creating Record`."
msgstr ""
"Yozuvlarni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri ko'rinish ichida yaratish va tahrirlash "
"uchun :guilabel:`When Creating Record` ostidan :guilabel:`Add record at the "
"bottom`, :guilabel:`Add record on top` yoki :guilabel:`Open form view` "
"variantlaridan birini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:155
msgid ""
"This prevents users from opening records in :ref:`Form view <studio/views/"
"general/form>` from the :guilabel:`List` view."
msgstr ""
"Bu foydalanuvchilarga yozuvlarni :guilabel:`List` ko'rinishidan :ref:`Forma "
"ko'rinishida <studio/views/general/form>` ochishga to'sqinlik qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:158
msgid "To edit several records at once, tick :guilabel:`Enable Mass Editing`."
msgstr ""
"Bir vaqtning o'zida bir nechta yozuvni tahrirlash uchun :guilabel:`Enable "
"Mass Editing` belgisini qo'ying."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:159
msgid ""
"To change the way records are sorted by default, select a field "
"under :guilabel:`Sort By`."
msgstr ""
"Yozuvlarning standart saralanish tartibini o'zgartirish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Sort By` ostidan maydonni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:161
msgid ""
"To add a button, click :guilabel:`Add a button` at the top of the list, "
"enter a :guilabel:`Label`, and select the button's action:"
msgstr ""
"Tugma qo'shish uchun ro'yxatning yuqorisidagi :guilabel:`Add a button` "
"tugmasini bosing, :guilabel:`Label` kiriting va tugmaning amalini tanlang:"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:168
msgid ""
"The widths of columns in a :guilabel:`List` :icon:`oi-view-list` view are "
"computed automatically to provide the optimal user experience. However, it "
"is also possible to set a fixed column width per field. To do so, click on "
"the relevant column to open the field's :icon:`fa-"
"server` :guilabel:`Properties` tab, then enter the desired number of pixels "
"in the :guilabel:`Column Width (px)` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`List` :icon:`oi-view-list` ko'rinishidagi ustunlarning kengligi "
"optimal foydalanuvchi tajribasini ta'minlash uchun avtomatik hisoblanadi. "
"Biroq, har bir maydon uchun qat'iy ustun kengligini o'rnatish ham mumkin. "
"Buning uchun maydonning :icon:`fa-server` :guilabel:`Properties` varag'ini "
"ochish uchun tegishli ustunni bosing, so'ngra :guilabel:`Column Width (px)` "
"maydoniga kerakli piksellar sonini kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:175
msgid ""
"To add a :icon:`oi-draggable` (:guilabel:`drag handle`) icon to reorder "
"records manually, add an :ref:`Integer field <studio/fields/simple-fields-"
"integer>` with the :guilabel:`Handle` widget."
msgstr ""
"Yozuvlarni qo'lda qayta tartiblash uchun :icon:`oi-draggable` "
"(:guilabel:`drag handle`) ikonkasini qo'shish maqsadida :guilabel:`Handle` "
"vidjetiga ega :ref:`Integer maydonini <studio/fields/simple-fields-integer>` "
"qo'shing."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:0
msgid "Drag handle icon enabling to sort records manually in List view"
msgstr ""
"Ro'yxat ko'rinishida yozuvlarni qo'lda saralash imkonini beruvchi sudrash "
"dastagi ikonkasi"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:0
msgid "Sales order model's List view"
msgstr "Sales order modelining ro'yxat ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:190
msgid "Map"
msgstr "Xarita"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:192
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Map` :icon:`fa-map-marker` view is used to display records on "
"a map. For example, it is used in the Field Service app to plan an itinerary "
"between different tasks."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Map` :icon:`fa-map-marker` ko'rinishi yozuvlarni xaritada "
"ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladi. Masalan, u Field Service ilovasida turli "
"vazifalar orasidagi marshrutni rejalashtirish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:196
msgid ""
"A :ref:`Many2One field <studio/fields/relational-fields-many2one>` linked to "
"the *Contact* model is required to activate the view, as the contact address "
"is used to position records on the map."
msgstr ""
"Ko'rinishni faollashtirish uchun *Contact* modeliga "
"bog'langan :ref:`Many2One maydoni <studio/fields/relational-fields-"
"many2one>` talab qilinadi, chunki kontakt manzili yozuvlarni xaritada "
"joylashtirish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:199
msgid ""
"To select which kind of contact should be used on the map, select it "
"under :guilabel:`Contact Field`."
msgstr ""
"Xaritada qanday turdagi kontakt ishlatilishini tanlash "
"uchun :guilabel:`Contact Field` ostidan uni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:201
msgid ""
"To hide the name or the address of the record, tick :guilabel:`Hide Name` "
"or :guilabel:`Hide Address`."
msgstr ""
"Yozuvning nomi yoki manzilini yashirish uchun :guilabel:`Hide Name` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Hide Address` belgisini qo'ying."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:203
msgid ""
"To add information from other fields, select them "
"under :guilabel:`Additional Fields`."
msgstr ""
"Boshqa maydonlardan ma'lumot qo'shish uchun ularni :guilabel:`Additional "
"Fields` ostidan tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:204
msgid ""
"To have a route suggested between the different records, "
"tick :guilabel:`Enable Routing` and select which field should be used to "
"sort records for the routing."
msgstr ""
"Turli yozuvlar orasida marshrut taklif qilinishi uchun :guilabel:`Enable "
"Routing` belgisini qo'ying va marshrutlash uchun yozuvlarni saralashda qaysi "
"maydon ishlatilishini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:0
msgid "Task model's Map view"
msgstr "Task modelining xarita ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:215
msgid "Timeline views"
msgstr "Vaqt chizig'i ko'rinishlari"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:218
msgid ""
"When you first activate one of the timeline views, you need to select "
"which :ref:`Date <studio/fields/simple-fields-date>` or :ref:`Date & Time "
"<studio/fields/simple-fields-date-time>` fields on your model should be used "
"to define when the records start and stop in order to display them on the "
"view. You can modify the :guilabel:`Start Date Field` and :guilabel:`Stop "
"Date Field` after activating the view."
msgstr ""
"Vaqt chizig'i ko'rinishlaridan birini birinchi marta faollashtirganingizda, "
"yozuvlarni ko'rinishda ko'rsatish maqsadida ularning boshlanish va tugash "
"vaqtini aniqlash uchun modelingizdagi qaysi :ref:`Date <studio/fields/simple-"
"fields-date>` yoki :ref:`Date & Time <studio/fields/simple-fields-date-"
"time>` maydonlari ishlatilishini tanlashingiz kerak. Ko'rinishni "
"faollashtirgandan so'ng :guilabel:`Start Date Field` va :guilabel:`Stop Date "
"Field` maydonlarini o'zgartirishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:229
msgid "Calendar"
msgstr "Kalendar"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:231
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Calendar` :icon:`fa-calendar` view is used to overview and "
"manage records inside a calendar."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Calendar` :icon:`fa-calendar` ko'rinishi yozuvlarni kalendar "
"ichida ko'rib chiqish va boshqarish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:234
msgid ""
"To create records directly within the view instead of opening the :ref:`Form "
"view <studio/views/general/form>`, enable :guilabel:`Quick Create`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Forma ko'rinishini <studio/views/general/form>` ochish o'rniga "
"yozuvlarni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri ko'rinish ichida yaratish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Quick Create` opsiyasini yoqing."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:238
msgid ""
"This only works on specific models that can be *quick-created* using only a "
"*name*. However, most models do not support quick creation and open "
"the :guilabel:`Form` view to fill in the required fields."
msgstr ""
"Bu faqat *nom* yordamida *tez yaratilishi* mumkin bo'lgan muayyan modellarda "
"ishlaydi. Biroq, aksariyat modellar tez yaratishni qo'llab-quvvatlamaydi va "
"majburiy maydonlarni to'ldirish uchun :guilabel:`Form` ko'rinishini ochadi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:242
msgid ""
"To color records on the calendar, select a field under :guilabel:`Color`. "
"All the records sharing the same value for that field are displayed using "
"the same color."
msgstr ""
"Kalendardagi yozuvlarni ranglash uchun :guilabel:`Color` ostidan maydonni "
"tanlang. Ushbu maydon uchun bir xil qiymatga ega bo'lgan barcha yozuvlar bir "
"xil rangda ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:246
msgid ""
"As the number of colors is limited, the same color can end up being assigned "
"to different values."
msgstr ""
"Ranglar soni cheklangan bo'lgani uchun, bir xil rang turli qiymatlarga "
"tayinlanib qolishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:249
msgid ""
"To display events lasting the whole day at the top of the calendar, select "
"a :ref:`Checkbox field <studio/fields/simple-fields-checkbox>` that "
"specifies if the event lasts the whole day."
msgstr ""
"Kun bo'yi davom etadigan tadbirlarni kalendarning yuqori qismida ko'rsatish "
"uchun tadbir kun bo'yi davom etishini belgilaydigan :ref:`Belgilash katagi "
"maydonini <studio/fields/simple-fields-checkbox>` tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:252
msgid ""
"To choose the default time scale used to display events, "
"select :guilabel:`Day`, :guilabel:`Week`, :guilabel:`Month`, "
"or :guilabel:`Year` under :guilabel:`Default Display Mode`."
msgstr ""
"Tadbirlarni ko'rsatishda ishlatiladigan standart vaqt shkalasini tanlash "
"uchun :guilabel:`Default Display Mode` "
"ostidan :guilabel:`Day`, :guilabel:`Week`, :guilabel:`Month` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Year` variantini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:256
msgid ""
"You can also use a :guilabel:`Delay Field` to display the duration of the "
"event in hours by selecting a :ref:`Decimal <studio/fields/simple-fields-"
"decimal>` or :ref:`Integer <studio/fields/simple-fields-integer>` field on "
"the model which specifies the duration of the event. However, if you set "
"an :guilabel:`End Date Field`, the :guilabel:`Delay Field` will not be taken "
"into account."
msgstr ""
"Shuningdek, tadbir davomiyligini belgilaydigan modeldagi :ref:`Decimal "
"<studio/fields/simple-fields-decimal>` yoki :ref:`Integer <studio/fields/"
"simple-fields-integer>` maydonini tanlash orqali tadbir davomiyligini "
"soatlarda ko'rsatish uchun :guilabel:`Delay Field` maydonidan "
"foydalanishingiz mumkin. Biroq, agar :guilabel:`End Date Field` "
"o'rnatsangiz, :guilabel:`Delay Field` hisobga olinmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:0
msgid "Calendar Event model's Calendar view"
msgstr "Calendar Event modelining kalendar ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:270
msgid "Cohort"
msgstr "Kogorta"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:272
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Cohort` :icon:`oi-view-cohort` view is used to examine the "
"life cycle of records over a time period. For example, it is used in the "
"Subscriptions app to view the subscriptions' retention rate."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cohort` :icon:`oi-view-cohort` ko'rinishi yozuvlarning hayotiy "
"siklini ma'lum vaqt davomida o'rganish uchun ishlatiladi. Masalan, u "
"Subscriptions ilovasida obunalarning saqlanish darajasini ko'rish uchun "
"ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:276
msgid ""
"To display a measure (i.e., the aggregated value of a given field) by "
"default on the view, select a :guilabel:`Measure Field`."
msgstr ""
"Ko'rinishda standart holatda o'lchovni (ya'ni, berilgan maydonning jamlangan "
"qiymatini) ko'rsatish uchun :guilabel:`Measure Field` tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:278
msgid ""
"To choose which time interval is used by default to group results, "
"select :guilabel:`Day`, :guilabel:`Week`, :guilabel:`Month`, "
"or :guilabel:`Year` under :guilabel:`Interval`."
msgstr ""
"Natijalarni guruhlash uchun standart holatda qaysi vaqt oralig'i "
"ishlatilishini tanlash uchun :guilabel:`Interval` "
"ostidan :guilabel:`Day`, :guilabel:`Week`, :guilabel:`Month` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Year` variantini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:280
msgid ""
"To change the cohort :guilabel:`Mode`, select "
"either :guilabel:`Retention` :dfn:`the percentage of records staying over a "
"period of time, it starts at 100% and decreases with time` "
"or :guilabel:`Churn` :dfn:`the percentage of records moving out over a "
"period of time - it starts at 0% and increases with time`."
msgstr ""
"Kogorta :guilabel:`Mode` rejimini o'zgartirish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Retention` :dfn:`the percentage of records staying over a "
"period of time, it starts at 100% and decreases with time` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Churn` :dfn:`the percentage of records moving out over a "
"period of time - it starts at 0% and increases with time` variantlaridan "
"birini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:284
msgid ""
"To change the way the :guilabel:`Timeline` (i.e., the columns) progresses, "
"select either :guilabel:`Forward` (from 0 to +15) or :guilabel:`Backward` "
"(from -15 to 0). For most purposes, the :guilabel:`Forward` timeline is used."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Timeline` (ya'ni, ustunlar) qanday tartibda o'sib borishini "
"o'zgartirish uchun :guilabel:`Forward` (0 dan +15 gacha) "
"yoki :guilabel:`Backward` (-15 dan 0 gacha) variantlaridan birini tanlang. "
"Ko'p hollarda :guilabel:`Forward` vaqt chizig'i ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:0
msgid "Subscription model's Cohort view"
msgstr "Subscription modelining kogorta ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:296
msgid "Gantt"
msgstr "Gantt"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:298
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Gantt` :icon:`fa-tasks` view is used to forecast and examine "
"the overall progress of records. Records are represented by a bar under a "
"time scale."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Gantt` :icon:`fa-tasks` ko'rinishi yozuvlarning umumiy jarayonini "
"prognoz qilish va o'rganish uchun ishlatiladi. Yozuvlar vaqt shkalasi "
"ostidagi chiziq bilan ifodalanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:301
msgid ""
"To prevent users from creating or editing records, untick :guilabel:`Can "
"Create` or :guilabel:`Can Edit`."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchilar yozuvlarni yaratishi yoki tahrirlashining oldini olish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Can Create` yoki :guilabel:`Can Edit` belgisini olib "
"tashlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:303
msgid ""
"To fill cells in gray whenever a record should not be created there (e.g., "
"on weekends for employees), tick :guilabel:`Display Unavailability`."
msgstr ""
"Yozuv yaratilmasligi kerak bo'lgan kataklarni kulrang bilan to'ldirish uchun "
"(masalan, xodimlar uchun dam olish kunlarida), :guilabel:`Display "
"Unavailability` belgisini qo'ying."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:307
msgid ""
"The underlying model must support this feature, and support for it cannot be "
"added using Studio. It is supported for the Project, Time Off, Planning, and "
"Manufacturing apps."
msgstr ""
"Asosiy model ushbu funksiyani qo'llab-quvvatlashi kerak va uni qo'llab-"
"quvvatlashni Studio yordamida qo'shib bo'lmaydi. U Project, Time Off, "
"Planning va Manufacturing ilovalari uchun qo'llab-quvvatlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:310
msgid "To show a total row at the bottom, tick :guilabel:`Display Total row`."
msgstr ""
"Pastda jami qatorini ko'rsatish uchun :guilabel:`Display Total row` "
"belgisini qo'ying."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:311
msgid ""
"To collapse multiple records in a single row, tick :guilabel:`Collapse First "
"Level`."
msgstr ""
"Bir nechta yozuvni bitta qatorga yig'ish uchun :guilabel:`Collapse First "
"Level` belgisini qo'ying."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:312
msgid ""
"To choose which way records are grouped by default on rows (e.g., per "
"employee or project), select a field under :guilabel:`Default Group by`."
msgstr ""
"Yozuvlar qatorlarda standart holatda qanday guruhlashini tanlash uchun "
"(masalan, xodim yoki loyiha bo'yicha), :guilabel:`Default Group by` ostidan "
"maydonni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:314
msgid ""
"To define a default time scale to view records, "
"select :guilabel:`Day`, :guilabel:`Week`, :guilabel:`Month`, "
"or :guilabel:`Year` under :guilabel:`Default Scale`."
msgstr ""
"Yozuvlarni ko'rish uchun standart vaqt shkalasini belgilash "
"uchun :guilabel:`Default Scale` "
"ostidan :guilabel:`Day`, :guilabel:`Week`, :guilabel:`Month` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Year` variantini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:316
msgid ""
"To color records on the view, select a field under :guilabel:`Color`. All "
"the records sharing the same value for that field are displayed using the "
"same color."
msgstr ""
"Ko'rinishdagi yozuvlarni ranglash uchun :guilabel:`Color` ostidan maydonni "
"tanlang. Ushbu maydon uchun bir xil qiymatga ega bo'lgan barcha yozuvlar bir "
"xil rangda ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:320
msgid ""
"As the number of colors is limited, the same color can be assigned to "
"different values."
msgstr ""
"Ranglar soni cheklangan bo'lgani uchun, bir xil rang turli qiymatlarga "
"tayinlanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:322
msgid ""
"To specify with which degree of precision each time scale should be divided "
"by, select :guilabel:`Quarter Hour`, :guilabel:`Half Hour`, "
"or :guilabel:`Hour` under :guilabel:`Day Precision`, :guilabel:`Half Day` "
"or :guilabel:`Day` under :guilabel:`Week Precision`, and :guilabel:`Month "
"Precision`."
msgstr ""
"Har bir vaqt shkalasi qanday aniqlik darajasida bo'linishini belgilash "
"uchun :guilabel:`Day Precision` ostidan :guilabel:`Quarter "
"Hour`, :guilabel:`Half Hour` yoki :guilabel:`Hour` "
"variantini, :guilabel:`Week Precision` ostidan :guilabel:`Half Day` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Day` variantini va :guilabel:`Month Precision` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:0
msgid "Planning Shift model's Gantt view"
msgstr "Planning Shift modelining gantt ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:335
msgid "Reporting views"
msgstr "Hisobot ko'rinishlari"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:344
msgid "Pivot"
msgstr "Pivot"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:346
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Pivot` :icon:`oi-view-pivot` view is used to explore and "
"analyze the data contained in records in an interactive manner. It is "
"especially useful to aggregate numeric data, create categories, and drill "
"down the data by expanding and collapsing different levels of data."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pivot` :icon:`oi-view-pivot` ko'rinishi yozuvlardagi "
"ma'lumotlarni interaktiv tarzda o'rganish va tahlil qilish uchun "
"ishlatiladi. U ayniqsa raqamli ma'lumotlarni jamlash, kategoriyalar yaratish "
"va ma'lumotlarning turli darajalarini yoyish va yig'ish orqali ma'lumotlarni "
"chuqur tahlil qilish uchun foydalidir."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:350
msgid ""
"To access all records whose data is aggregated under a cell, "
"tick :guilabel:`Access records from cell`."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlari katak ostida jamlangan barcha yozuvlarga kirish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Access records from cell` belgisini qo'ying."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:352
msgid ""
"To divide the data into different categories, select field(s) "
"under :guilabel:`Column grouping`, :guilabel:`Row grouping - First level`, "
"or :guilabel:`Row grouping - Second level`."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlarni turli toifalarga bo'lish uchun :guilabel:`Column "
"grouping`, :guilabel:`Row grouping - First level` yoki :guilabel:`Row "
"grouping - Second level` ostidan maydon(lar)ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:354
msgid ""
"To add different types of data to be measured using the view, select a field "
"under :guilabel:`Measures`."
msgstr ""
"Ko'rinish yordamida o'lchanadigan turli ma'lumot turlarini qo'shish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Measures` ostidan maydonni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:356
msgid ""
"To display a count of records that made up the aggregated data in a cell, "
"tick :guilabel:`Display count`."
msgstr ""
"Katakdagi jamlangan ma'lumotlarni tashkil etgan yozuvlar sonini ko'rsatish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Display count` belgilash katagini belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:0
msgid "Purchase Report model's Pivot view"
msgstr "Purchase Report modelining pivot ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:367
msgid "Graph"
msgstr "Grafik"

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:369
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Graph` :icon:`fa-area-chart` view is used to showcase data "
"from records in a bar, line, or pie chart."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Graph` :icon:`fa-area-chart` ko'rinishi yozuvlardagi "
"ma'lumotlarni ustunli, chiziqli yoki doiraviy diagramma ko'rinishida "
"ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:372
msgid ""
"To change the default chart, select :guilabel:`Bar`, :guilabel:`Line`, "
"or :guilabel:`Pie` under :guilabel:`Type`."
msgstr ""
"Standart diagrammani o'zgartirish uchun :guilabel:`Type` "
"ostidan :guilabel:`Bar`, :guilabel:`Line` yoki :guilabel:`Pie` variantini "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:374
msgid ""
"To choose a default data dimension (category), select a field "
"under :guilabel:`First dimension` and, if needed, another "
"under :guilabel:`Second dimension`."
msgstr ""
"Standart ma'lumot o'lchamini (toifasini) tanlash uchun :guilabel:`First "
"dimension` ostidan maydonni tanlang va zarur bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Second "
"dimension` ostidan yana birini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:376
msgid ""
"To select a default type of data to be measured using the view, select a "
"field under :guilabel:`Measure`."
msgstr ""
"Ko'rinish yordamida o'lchanadigan standart ma'lumot turini tanlash "
"uchun :guilabel:`Measure` ostidan maydonni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:378
msgid ""
"*For Bar and Line charts only*: To sort the different data categories by "
"their value, select :guilabel:`Ascending` (from lowest to highest value) "
"or :guilabel:`Descending` (from highest to lowest) under :guilabel:`Sorting`."
msgstr ""
"*Faqat ustunli va chiziqli diagrammalar uchun*: Turli ma'lumot toifalarini "
"qiymati bo'yicha saralash uchun :guilabel:`Sorting` "
"ostidan :guilabel:`Ascending` (eng pastdan eng yuqori qiymatgacha) "
"yoki :guilabel:`Descending` (eng yuqoridan eng pastgacha) variantini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:381
msgid ""
"*For Bar and Pie charts only*: To access all records whose data is "
"aggregated under a data category on the chart, tick :guilabel:`Access "
"records from graph`."
msgstr ""
"*Faqat ustunli va doiraviy diagrammalar uchun*: Diagrammadagi ma'lumot "
"toifasi ostida ma'lumotlari jamlangan barcha yozuvlarga kirish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Access records from graph` belgilash katagini belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:383
msgid ""
"*For Bar charts only*: When using two data dimensions (categories), display "
"the two columns on top of each other by default by "
"ticking :guilabel:`Stacked graph`."
msgstr ""
"*Faqat ustunli diagrammalar uchun*: Ikki ma'lumot o'lchami (toifasi) "
"ishlatilganda, ikkita ustunni standart holatda bir-birining ustida "
"ko'rsatish uchun :guilabel:`Stacked graph` belgilash katagini belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/views.rst:0
msgid "Sales Analysis Report model's Bar chart on Graph view"
msgstr ""
"Sales Analysis Report modelining grafik ko'rinishidagi ustunli diagrammasi"
